```text
Board of County Commissioners
Meeting Agenda - Final
January 7, 2025
Contract/Agreement/Leases
15. Consideration
of
an
agreement
between
the
city
of
Cheyenne
and
Laramie County, WY,  to create a Human Services Advisory Council. The
council will coordinate and refine human services funding and delivery
systems now in effect and those initiated as outlined in the Powers and
Duties section of the agreement. The city and county each agree to
provide $10,500 per year for four years to United Way to facilitate the
implementation of the council duties. This agreement is for FYs 24, 25, 26,
and 27, beginning July 1, 2023, and ending on June 30, 2027.
Dept: County Attorney
Agent: Brad Lund
Applicant:
Agreement, City of Cheyenne, Human Services
Advisory Council
Attachments:
Appointments
